---
import Label from './Label.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import tony from '../assets/tony.jpg';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="section" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="why__head">
      <Label>Why me</Label>
      <h2 class="h2 why__title" id="why-title" data-split>
        Most editors edit for <span class="strike" data-strike>editors</span><br>
        I edit for the <span class="sel" data-sel>viewer</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead" data-reveal>Flashy effects look great in a portfolio, but they can pull attention away from your message. I use motion where it helps, and give the same care to story, pacing, sound and color: the things viewers feel, even when they don't notice them.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="tile tile--story" data-reveal data-tile="story">
        <div class="tile__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="script">
            <p><span class="num">0:00</span><span>You're losing viewers in the <mark data-mark>first 10 seconds</mark>.</span></p>
            <p><span class="num">0:04</span><span>Here's the one change that <mark data-mark>fixed it for me</mark>.</span></p>
            <p><span class="num">0:09</span><span>And it's not what you think.</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Story first</h3>
        <p>I find the moments that matter, cut what drags and keep the video moving toward your offer.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--craft" data-reveal data-tile="craft">
        <div class="tile__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="insp">
            <div class="insp__row"><span>Sound</span><div class="insp__meter">{Array.from({ length: 14 }).map(() => <i data-meter></i>)}</div></div>
            <div class="insp__row"><span>Color</span><div class="insp__grade"><i data-grade-knob></i></div></div>
            <div class="insp__row"><span>Motion</span><svg class="insp__curve" viewBox="0 0 100 30" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path data-curve d="M2 28 C40 28 52 2 98 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Sound, color &amp; clean motion</h3>
        <p>They get the same care as the cut, because viewers feel all of it.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--creator" data-reveal data-tile="creator">
        <div class="tile__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="channel">
            <Picture src={tony} formats={['avif', 'webp']} width={96} height={96} alt="" class="channel__avatar" />
            <div class="channel__text"><b>Tony J Edits</b><small>@{site.handle} on YouTube</small></div>
            <span class="channel__sub" data-sub><span>Subscribe</span><span>Subscribed</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>A creator's mindset</h3>
        <p>I run my own YouTube channel, so I know how creators work, what they need from an editor and where viewers drop off.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tile tile--clean" data-reveal data-tile="clean">
        <div class="tile__art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="vs">
            <figure class="vs__side vs__side--them" data-them>
              <figcaption><i></i>Other editors</figcaption>
              <div class="vs__frame vs__frame--them" data-chaos>
                <span class="vs__flash" data-flash></span>
                <span class="vs__subject"></span>
                <span class="vs__fx" data-fx>GLITCH</span>
                <span class="vs__fx" data-fx>💥</span>
                <span class="vs__fx" data-fx>ZOOM</span>
                <span class="vs__fx" data-fx>😱</span>
                <span class="vs__fx" data-fx>SHAKE</span>
                <span class="vs__fx" data-fx>🔥🔥</span>
                <span class="vs__fx" data-fx>3D SPIN</span>
                <span class="vs__banner" data-banner>SUBSCRIBE!!!</span>
                <span class="vs__cap vs__cap--them" data-bounce>THIS IS <b>INSANE</b>!!</span>
                <span class="vs__dim" data-them-dim></span>
              </div>
            </figure>
            <figure class="vs__side vs__side--me" data-me>
              <figcaption><i></i>Me</figcaption>
              <div class="vs__frame vs__frame--me">
                <span class="vs__zoom" data-me-zoom><span class="vs__light"></span><span class="vs__subject"></span></span>
                <span class="vs__cap vs__cap--me"><span data-word>Clear,</span> <span data-word>easy</span> <span data-word>to</span> <span data-word>follow</span></span>
              </div>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Clear, not cluttered</h3>
        <p>Lots of edits throw every effect at the screen. I use motion to guide the eye, so the whole video feels smooth and is easy to follow.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why__head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px); }
  .why__head .lead { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 38em; }
  .why__title { max-width: 14em; }
  .strike { position: relative; display: inline-block; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .strike::after {
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: -.04em; right: -.04em; top: 54%;
    height: max(3px, .06em); border-radius: 9px; background: var(--accent);
    transform: scaleX(var(--strike, 0)); transform-origin: left;
  }

  .bento { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: clamp(16px, 2vw, 22px); }
  .tile--story { grid-column: span 3; }
  .tile--craft { grid-column: span 2; }
  .tile--creator { grid-column: span 2; }
  .tile--clean { grid-column: span 3; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tile { grid-column: auto !important; }
  }

  .tile {
    padding: 12px 12px 28px; border-radius: 30px;
    position: relative; isolation: isolate;
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    transition: transform .8s var(--ease), border-color .8s var(--ease);
  }
  .tile::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; border-radius: inherit; box-shadow: 0 30px 70px -30px rgba(40,20,120,.32); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .8s var(--ease); pointer-events: none; }
  @media (hover: hover) { .tile:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: var(--accent-100); } .tile:hover::after { opacity: 1; } }
  .tile__art {
    position: relative; height: 220px; margin-bottom: 22px; overflow: hidden;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    border-radius: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: radial-gradient(90% 80% at 50% 0%, rgba(107,75,255,.08), transparent 65%), var(--bg);
  }
  .tile h3 { padding-inline: 14px; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 640; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .tile p { padding-inline: 14px; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-3); max-width: 34em; }

  .script { width: min(88%, 440px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; text-align: left; }
  .script p { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; margin: 0; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: .9rem; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: none; }
  .script p:nth-child(3) { opacity: .55; }
  .script .num { flex: none; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-700); }
  .script mark { color: inherit; background: linear-gradient(var(--accent-soft), var(--accent-soft)) 0 0 / 0% 100% no-repeat; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 2px; }

  .insp { width: min(86%, 300px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: var(--shadow-1); }
  .insp__row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 10px; height: 30px; }
  .insp__row > span { font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .insp__meter { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 3px; height: 26px; }
  .insp__meter i { flex: 1; height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(0deg, #3FAE73 0 60%, #F5C04A 60% 85%, #E5484D 85%); transform: scaleY(.2); transform-origin: bottom; animation: meter .5s ease-in-out infinite alternate; animation-play-state: paused; }
  .insp__meter i:nth-child(2n) { animation-duration: .38s; animation-delay: -.2s; }
  .insp__meter i:nth-child(3n) { animation-duration: .62s; animation-delay: -.4s; }
  .insp__meter i:nth-child(5n+1) { animation-duration: .44s; animation-delay: -.1s; }
  .tile.is-live .insp__meter i { animation-play-state: running; }
  @keyframes meter { from { transform: scaleY(.18); } to { transform: scaleY(.95); } }
  .insp__grade { position: relative; height: 10px; border-radius: 10px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7D8290, #F7A86B 45%, #7B4BFF 75%, #2A1E5C); }
  .insp__grade i { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 50%; width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: -9px 0 0 -9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25), 0 0 0 1px var(--line); }
  .insp__curve { width: 100%; height: 28px; color: var(--accent); overflow: visible; }


  .channel { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; width: min(88%, 380px); padding: 12px 12px 12px 14px; border-radius: 18px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: var(--shadow-1); }
  .channel :global(.channel__avatar) { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
  .channel :global(picture) { display: block; flex: none; }
  .channel__text { min-width: 0; }
  .channel__text b, .channel__text small { white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .channel { gap: 10px; padding: 10px; width: 92%; }
    .channel :global(.channel__avatar) { width: 38px; height: 38px; }
    .channel__sub { height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; font-size: .74rem; flex: none; }
  }
  .channel__text b { display: block; font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 640; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .channel__text small { display: block; font-size: .76rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .channel__sub { position: relative; display: inline-grid; margin-left: auto; height: 36px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: var(--r-pill); background: var(--ink); color: #fff; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 620; overflow: hidden; transition: background-color .6s var(--ease), color .6s var(--ease); }
  .channel__sub span { grid-area: 1 / 1; display: grid; place-items: center; transition: transform .7s var(--ease), opacity .5s var(--ease); }
  .channel__sub span + span { transform: translateY(100%); opacity: 0; }
  .channel__sub.is-on { background: var(--bg-2); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .channel__sub.is-on span:first-child { transform: translateY(-100%); opacity: 0; }
  .channel__sub.is-on span + span { transform: none; opacity: 1; }

  .vs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; width: min(92%, 470px); }
  .vs__side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .vs__side figcaption { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 650; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .vs__side figcaption i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .vs__side--them figcaption i { background: #E5484D; }
  .vs__side--me figcaption i { background: var(--accent); }
  .vs__frame { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #3A3550, #1E1B2B); box-shadow: var(--shadow-2); }
  .vs__frame--me { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent-200), var(--shadow-2); }
  .vs__subject { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 0; width: 38%; height: 64%; transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0 / 40% 40% 0 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8F7BD8, #5B4AA0); }
  .vs__subject::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -34%; width: 50%; aspect-ratio: 1; transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: 50%; background: #A794E6; }
  .vs__flash { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; background: linear-gradient(120deg, #FF3D7F, #FFB020, #22C3E6); opacity: 0; }

  /* the chaos is pure CSS (GPU), and only runs while the card is on screen */
  .vs__dim { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 4; background: rgba(246,245,248,.72); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .vs__zoom { position: absolute; inset: 0; transform-origin: 50% 40%; }
  .vs__light { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 18%; width: 90%; height: 90%; transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(180,160,255,.35), transparent); }
  .vs__frame--them { animation: chaos 1.3s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes chaos {
    0% { transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0) scale(1); }
    8% { transform: translate(-3px, 2px) rotate(-1.5deg) scale(1.06); }
    16% { transform: translate(3px, -2px) rotate(1.2deg) scale(1); }
    24% { transform: translate(-2px, -3px) rotate(-.8deg) scale(1); }
    32% { transform: translate(4px, 1px) rotate(2deg) scale(1.08); }
    40% { transform: translate(-4px, 2px) rotate(-2deg) scale(1); }
    50% { transform: translate(2px, 3px) rotate(1deg) scale(1); }
    60% { transform: translate(-3px, -1px) rotate(-1.4deg) scale(1.05); }
    70% { transform: translate(3px, -3px) rotate(1.8deg) scale(1); }
    80% { transform: translate(-1px, 2px) rotate(-.6deg) scale(1); }
    90% { transform: translate(2px, -2px) rotate(1.4deg) scale(1.07); }
    100% { transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0) scale(1); }
  }
  .vs__flash { animation: flash 1.1s steps(1) infinite; }
  @keyframes flash { 0% { opacity: 0; } 12% { opacity: .6; } 20% { opacity: 0; } 46% { opacity: .45; } 52% { opacity: 0; } 70% { opacity: .7; } 78% { opacity: .1; } 88% { opacity: 0; } }
  .vs__fx { animation: fx .32s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(2n) { animation-duration: .26s; animation-delay: -.1s; }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(3n) { animation-duration: .4s; animation-delay: -.2s; }
  @keyframes fx { from { transform: rotate(-14deg) scale(.9); } to { transform: rotate(16deg) scale(1.22); } }
  .vs__banner { animation: banner .18s linear infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes banner { from { transform: rotate(-6deg) translateX(-4px); } to { transform: rotate(-5deg) translateX(4px); } }
  .vs__cap--them { animation: bounce .3s ease-out infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes bounce { from { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(-3deg) scale(1); } to { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(-2deg) scale(1.22); } }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(1) { left: 6%; top: 22%; } .vs__fx:nth-of-type(2) { left: 70%; top: 20%; }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(3) { left: 8%; top: 52%; } .vs__fx:nth-of-type(4) { left: 76%; top: 50%; }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(5) { left: 56%; top: 34%; } .vs__fx:nth-of-type(6) { left: 26%; top: 34%; }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(7) { left: 62%; top: 66%; }
  .vs__fx { position: absolute; z-index: 2; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 5px; background: #FF3D7F; color: #fff; font-size: .58rem; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px -3px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(3n) { background: #FFB020; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(3n+1) { background: #22C3E6; }
  .vs__fx:nth-of-type(2), .vs__fx:nth-of-type(4), .vs__fx:nth-of-type(6) { background: none; box-shadow: none; font-size: .9rem; padding: 0; }
  .vs__banner { position: absolute; z-index: 2; left: -6%; right: -6%; top: 6%; padding: 3px 0; background: #E5484D; color: #fff; font-size: .62rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .08em; text-align: center; transform: rotate(-6deg); }
  .vs__cap { position: absolute; z-index: 3; left: 50%; bottom: 9%; white-space: nowrap; }
  .vs__cap--them { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(-3deg); padding: 2px 6px; background: #FFE600; color: #111; font-size: .62rem; font-weight: 900; text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #FF3D7F, -2px -1px 0 #22C3E6; border-radius: 4px; }
  .vs__cap--them b { color: #E5484D; }
  .vs__cap--me { transform: translateX(-50%); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(0,0,0,.6); color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .vs__cap--me [data-word] { transition: color .3s ease; }
  .vs__cap--me [data-word].is-on { color: #fff; }

  /* Play/pause gate. Must stay LAST: the `animation:` shorthands above reset play-state to running.
     Chaos only plays during the short "other editors" phase, then freezes on its current frame. */
  .vs__frame--them, .vs__flash, .vs__fx, .vs__banner, .vs__cap--them { animation-play-state: paused; }
  .tile.is-live.is-chaos .vs__frame--them, .tile.is-live.is-chaos .vs__flash, .tile.is-live.is-chaos .vs__fx, .tile.is-live.is-chaos .vs__banner, .tile.is-live.is-chaos .vs__cap--them { animation-play-state: running; }
</style>
